{"height": 14, "weight": 1506, "base_experience": 239, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "hp", "value": 3}], "genus": "Ice Break Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium-slow", "egg_groups": ["water1", "ground"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "トドゼルガ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Todoseruga"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "씨카이저"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "帝牙海獅"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Kaimorse"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Walraisa"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Walrein"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Walrein"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "トドゼルガ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "帝牙海狮"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Walrein"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["ruby"], "text": "WALREIN’s two massively developed tusks can totally shatter blocks of ice weighing ten tons with one blow. This POKéMON’s thick coat of blubber insulates it from subzero temperatures."}, {"versions": ["sapphire"], "text": "WALREIN swims all over in frigid seawater while crushing icebergs with its grand, imposing tusks. Its thick layer of blubber makes enemy attacks bounce off harmlessly."}, {"versions": ["emerald"], "text": "To protect its herd, the leader battles anything that invades its territory, even at the cost of its life. Its tusks may snap off in battle."}, {"versions": ["firered", "leafgreen"], "text": "It swims through icy seas while shattering ice floes with its large tusks. It is protected by its thick blubber."}, {"versions": ["diamond", "pearl", "platinum", "black", "white", "x"], "text": "It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks."}, {"versions": ["heartgold", "soulsilver", "y"], "text": "It shatters drift ice with its strong tusks. Its thick layer of blubber repels enemy attacks."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2"], "text": "Not only does its thick blubber keep it warm, it also protects it from attacks. It shatters ice 